    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like i'm being held hostage by my own biology. it feels so undignified to just wait around for the slow decay. i wish i could just be the one to decide when the struggle is over. wouldn't it be more peaceful to just... step out of it on my own terms?",
